booth","html_url":"https://github.com/benjaminbooth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjaminbooth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/check-suites/123025281262","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/rerun","previous_attempt_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/runs/45465920350/attempts/1","workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private/actions/workflows/252094498","head_commit":{"id":"90d5127e57916e797517db7aa5fb6d7feffcf5be","tree_id":"09b0cd636190e1bb3e4fc266c868f11e13c7b4a6","message":"fix(llm): an OpenAI stream ends with whole usage or none, and the bridge's prefix session id survives a moved cache marker (#2373)\n\nTwo faults found reviewing 0.70.46.\n\n#2229 made every OpenAI-format stream end with a usage object that held\nonly prompt_tokens_details. A client that reads usage.prompt_tokens when\nusage is present found nothing there. The last chunk now carries\nprompt_tokens, completion_tokens, total_tokens and the cached count when\nthe provider reported usage, and no usage at all when it did not, as\nbefore #2229.\n\n#2250 hashes the system prompt, the tools and the first message into a\nconversation id when a harness states none. Since #2229 the first message\nkeeps its cache marker, which a harness moves to the newest message each\nturn, so the id changed after turn 1. Cache markers are left out of the\nhashed prefix.\n\nThe docstring now says what the prefix cannot do: the bridge has no caller\nidentity, so two conversations with the same opening share an id unless\nthe harness sends a session header.\n\nSigned-off-by: Benjamin Booth <12017+benjaminbooth@users.noreply.github.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T19:02:12Z","author":{"name":"Benjamin Booth","email":"12017+benjaminbooth@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1192883564,"node_id":"R_kgDORxn1bA","name":"axiom-os-private","full_name":"b-tree-labs/axiom-os-private","private":true,"owner":{"login":"b-tree-labs","id":238139832,"node_id":"O_kgDODjG5uA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238139832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs","html_url":"https://github.com/b-tree-labs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-tree-labs/repos","events_url":"https://api.